        DiffStyleTS: Diffusion <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> for Style Transfer in Time Series
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nagda%2C+M">Mayank Nagda</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ostheimer%2C+P">Phil Ostheimer</a>, 
      
