        Task-Aware Reduction for Scalable LLM-Database Systems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Barnes%2C+M+E">Marcus Emmanuel Barnes</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ghaleb%2C+T+A">Taher A. Ghaleb</a>, 
      
